{"5077080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mall Tidy Up Frenemies", "steam_appid": 5077080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every misplaced product has a home. Go find it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole mall's worth of stock is in all the wrong places. Nobody is coming to fix it except you and seven frenemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/a469e8ad118152c3baaa2a12539e7c3a.poster.avif?t=1787921140\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/a469e8ad118152c3baaa2a12539e7c3a.webm?t=1787921140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/a469e8ad118152c3baaa2a12539e7c3a.mp4?t=1787921140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND IT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No checklist. The item is the clue: name, the art on the box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work out the store, the section, the shelf.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot it in and watch the row fill up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/1aed84c126fa29602c4acb27c3ae84d5.poster.avif?t=1787921140\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/1aed84c126fa29602c4acb27c3ae84d5.webm?t=1787921140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/1aed84c126fa29602c4acb27c3ae84d5.mp4?t=1787921140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVE IT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haul an armful across the mall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or charge up and throw it clear across the mall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up until items fly their own route and shelve themselves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/11b60bc3dfc9dab5f4c8e0a29bcb3b07.poster.avif?t=1787921140\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/11b60bc3dfc9dab5f4c8e0a29bcb3b07.webm?t=1787921140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/11b60bc3dfc9dab5f4c8e0a29bcb3b07.mp4?t=1787921140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RACE THEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 players, one mall, one shared goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live standings show who shelved more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rolling solo? AI players haul, level up and compete alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/bbad7abec2cab1be4cdcd428fe1044d1.poster.avif?t=1787921140\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/bbad7abec2cab1be4cdcd428fe1044d1.webm?t=1787921140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/bbad7abec2cab1be4cdcd428fe1044d1.mp4?t=1787921140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET FASTER</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tidying earns XP. XP buys perks across four branches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities: see matching items through walls, pull stock to your hands, claim a shelf row in your name.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/a609373f986e73f30156ccc84cc20d8e.poster.avif?t=1787921140\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/a609373f986e73f30156ccc84cc20d8e.webm?t=1787921140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077080/extras/a609373f986e73f30156ccc84cc20d8e.mp4?t=1787921140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NEW MALL EVERY TIME</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mall is generated fresh: 1 to 3 floors, new stores, new shelves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your chaos: neat mounds, cluttered corridors, or stock shuffled into entirely wrong stores.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MODE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard: play until the mall is fully restored. The win belongs to everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed: beat the clock, top the standings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save any mall, come back later. Global leaderboards, lifetime stats, full character customization.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every misplaced product has a home. Go find it.</strong></h2><p